PharmaShield: Cybersecurity Automation Framework for Pharmaceutical Manufacturing

1. Executive Summary
PharmaShield is a cybersecurity framework designed to protect automated pharmaceutical manufacturing
systems. It leverages AI, machine learning, and secure protocols to identify and neutralize cyber threats in
real-time.

2. Introduction
The pharmaceutical industry is evolving into a smart, interconnected environment under Pharma 4.0. While
automation increases efficiency, it also introduces cybersecurity vulnerabilities. PharmaShield addresses
these challenges with an integrated, AI-driven approach.

3. System Architecture Overview
The PharmaShield framework includes:
- Edge Devices (IoT sensors & PLCs)
- Central AI/ML Processing Unit
- Secure Communication Protocols
- Threat Detection & Response Layer

